abstract: >-
  Small, reproducible experiments run on a laptop: a ReAct agent with a 3B
  local model on English and Roman Urdu questions, including a name-swap
  robustness check; one year of PM2.5 data for Lahore and six Pakistani cities
  against the WHO guideline; and a base-rate model of AI road-safety camera
  flags in the UK. Code is MIT-licensed; third-party data keeps its original
  licence.
